WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:01.201
Insane.

00:00:01.201 --> 00:00:03.436
Pathetic, a disgrace.

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:05.405
I'm S.E. Cupp. Welcome to Unfiltered.

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:06.773
Believe it or not.

00:00:06.773 --> 00:00:08.408
Those were the words right

00:00:08.408 --> 00:00:10.577
wing voices used to describe

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:12.178
Donald Trump's attack on his own.

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:13.713
Former press secretary

00:00:13.713 --> 00:00:15.582
Kayleigh McEnany this week.

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:16.483
In case you missed it,

00:00:16.483 --> 00:00:18.118
McEnany went on Fox News,

00:00:18.118 --> 00:00:19.152
where she is now

00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:20.286
a contributor

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:20.820
to discuss

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.789
the Republican primary polls and noted

00:00:22.789 --> 00:00:24.991
that Trump was polling at 34%

00:00:25.258 --> 00:00:26.760
in Iowa in April

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:28.528
and is now down to 25%,

00:00:28.528 --> 00:00:30.597
according to McLaughlin and Associates,

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:32.732
Trump's preferred pollster.

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:34.200
Her former boss didn't like that,

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.603
so he took to Truth Social blasting

00:00:36.603 --> 00:00:38.671
the woman who supported him dutifully

00:00:38.671 --> 00:00:40.273
since 2017 first

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:41.174
as Republican

00:00:41.174 --> 00:00:43.243
National Committee spokeswoman and later

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:45.512
as his press secretary,

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:46.579
Kayleigh Milquetoast

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:47.714
McEnany just gave out

00:00:47.714 --> 00:00:49.682
the wrong poll numbers on Fox News,

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:50.850
Trump wrote

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:53.686
I am 34 points up on the sanctimonious

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:55.221
not 25 up.

00:00:55.221 --> 00:00:57.257
Well, 25 is great it's not 34.

00:00:57.424 --> 00:00:59.059
She knew the number was corrected

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:01.861
upwards by the group that did that poll.

00:01:01.861 --> 00:01:02.929
Notably, McLaughlin

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:03.730
does not appear

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:05.665
to have corrected the poll that McEnany

00:01:05.665 --> 00:01:07.100
accurately cited.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:08.368
But Trump concluded his post,

00:01:08.368 --> 00:01:09.402
saying the rhinos

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:11.438
and globalists can have her.

00:01:11.438 --> 00:01:13.840
Fox News should only use real stars.

00:01:14.641 --> 00:01:15.809
It was a brutal swipe

00:01:15.809 --> 00:01:18.044
at someone who was just doing her job.

00:01:18.044 --> 00:01:19.379
So brutal, in fact,

00:01:19.379 --> 00:01:20.880
that many on the right

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:22.449
came to her defense.

00:01:22.449 --> 00:01:23.416
Newsmax host

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:24.684
Rob Finnerty said,

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:25.452
I don't like it,

00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:27.220
especially with someone like Kayleigh

00:01:27.220 --> 00:01:28.988
McEnany who's seemingly

00:01:28.988 --> 00:01:31.391
so loyal to her former boss.

00:01:31.391 --> 00:01:32.158
Fox News host

00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:34.561
Brian Kilmeade called it insane.

00:01:34.561 --> 00:01:36.663
Blaze TV host Chad Prather called it

00:01:36.663 --> 00:01:38.698
pathetic, unacceptable. And unhinged.

00:01:39.399 --> 00:01:40.567
Trump's former deputy

00:01:40.567 --> 00:01:41.935
director of communications,

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:44.237
Matt Woking, called it a disgrace.

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:46.339
And Fox News political

00:01:46.339 --> 00:01:49.509
analyst Brit Hume tweeted Imagine being

00:01:49.509 --> 00:01:51.177
so immature as to attack

00:01:51.177 --> 00:01:52.912
your former press secretary

00:01:52.912 --> 00:01:53.446
who was nothing

00:01:53.446 --> 00:01:54.214
if not loyal

00:01:54.214 --> 00:01:56.583
for allegedly misquoting a poll number.

00:01:57.517 --> 00:01:59.119
This backlash against Trump from

00:01:59.119 --> 00:02:00.620
the right is remarkable

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:02.589
for a few reasons. One.

00:02:02.589 --> 00:02:03.590
Obviously, Kayleigh

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:05.825
McEnany is very well-liked,

00:02:05.825 --> 00:02:06.693
so well-liked

00:02:06.693 --> 00:02:07.927
that those in conservative

00:02:07.927 --> 00:02:08.761
circles

00:02:08.761 --> 00:02:11.297
are willing to attack him, to defend her.

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:13.833
I had the pleasure of working with Kelly

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:15.869
while she was a pundit here at CNN.

00:02:16.369 --> 00:02:18.271
And while we disagreed often,

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:19.372
she was smart,

00:02:19.372 --> 00:02:21.074
prepared, thoughtful,

00:02:21.074 --> 00:02:23.443
kind and a total pro.

00:02:23.443 --> 00:02:24.611
And I second

00:02:24.611 --> 00:02:26.346
all the kind words said about her.

00:02:26.346 --> 00:02:27.547
But it's also revealing

00:02:27.547 --> 00:02:29.616
that Trump is no longer above reproach,

00:02:29.616 --> 00:02:31.818
even among those who once supported him.

00:02:32.318 --> 00:02:32.852
Attacking

00:02:32.852 --> 00:02:34.954
McEnany was obviously an indignity,

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:36.122
not worth suffering

00:02:36.122 --> 00:02:37.090
for a political movement

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:38.558
that suffered happily

00:02:38.558 --> 00:02:39.425
through plenty of them.

00:02:40.693 --> 00:02:40.927
But the

00:02:40.927 --> 00:02:43.796
takeaway for me is bigger than Kayleigh.

00:02:44.364 --> 00:02:45.798
What this says is

00:02:45.798 --> 00:02:47.734
that Trump can go too far

00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:49.602
in shooting inside the tent,

00:02:49.602 --> 00:02:51.337
a presidential opponent like Senator

00:02:51.337 --> 00:02:53.606
Tim Scott of South Carolina, for example,

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:56.176
who is very well-liked in Congress,

00:02:56.176 --> 00:02:58.578
the Republican Party and his home state

00:02:58.578 --> 00:03:00.947
won't be easy for Trump to attack,

00:03:01.247 --> 00:03:03.283
especially if he doesn't dirty.

00:03:03.283 --> 00:03:05.251
As we all know he can.

00:03:05.251 --> 00:03:05.485
Look,

00:03:05.485 --> 00:03:06.152
I'm sure Trump

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:08.354
has plenty of fight left in him,

00:03:08.354 --> 00:03:11.558
but Kelly might just be a canary in the

00:03:11.558 --> 00:03:12.592
coal mine.

00:03:12.692 --> 00:03:14.360
That's it for me. See you next week.

